# SAM4S8C boot/connect smoke test. SAM4S is the only chip in the
# Renode-backed scope whose platform comes entirely from upstream
# Renode (platforms/cpus/sam4s8b.repl) - no local repl override and
# no Python.PythonPeripheral stubs from renode_launcher.py. That
# makes this the canary for upstream Renode SAM4S regressions: if
# upstream changes its SAM4S_EEFC / SAM_USART / PMC_SR models in a
# way that breaks the boot path, this test fails before any of the
# locally-extended Atmel chips do.
DICTIONARY sam4s8c.dict
CONFIG sam4s_smoke.cfg
EMULATOR sam4s_smoke.fixture.json

M114
M105
M105
M105

EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
